## 14. DEVELOPMENT LOG
`.docs/DEV_LOG.md` = append-only milestone history (I/O per #0.1).
- **Read**: only when the user `@`s it, or on「更新」sync turn; auto-reading prohibited.
- **Write**: only on unified keyword **「更新」**（及 #0.1 所列同义）→ 与 `memory.md` **同轮**：追加一条已确认重大功能 / 核心模块 / 里程碑 → `[System: DEV_LOG.md 已同步]`。
- If the file does not exist: create it only when「更新」is triggered.
- **Format**: written in Simplified Chinese, Markdown table:
  `| 日期 | 里程碑 | 完成模块 | 简要描述 |`

